        <mxCell id="c27" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Fluxo:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;1. o aluno executa o deploy-azure.sh (Azure CLI) -&amp;gt; 2. o Azure cria resource group, rede, IP público, NSG e a VM&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;3. a VM instala o Docker, clona o GitHub e gera a imagem pelo Dockerfile&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;4.&amp;nbsp; o container nuclear-api sobe na porta 8080&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;5. o usuário acessa http://IP-PUBLICO:8080/swagger-ui.html" vertex="1">
